y; no konflux-chain epic exists, so the build\n95\tpipeline AC does not apply. No AC states an externally-controlled precondition — the\n96\ttechnical review is work the epic obtains and records, and all other ACs condition\n97\twhat the epic itself builds or verifies. No epic body references sibling epics by\n98\tdraft ID; E001 refers to the documentation work only descriptively.\n99\t\n100\t### 7. Completeness (2/2)\n101\tThe strategy's full scope is covered: keyboard operability of the four flows (E001),\n102\tfocus-indicator consistency (E001), and VPAT plus accessibility-statement update,\n103\ttechnical review, and republication (E002). Out-of-scope boundaries (screen-reader\n104\tsemantics beyond keyboard fixes, flows outside the four) are respected in both epics'\n105\tScope sections, and the scope trap — the VPAT must not claim conformance beyond the\n106\tkeyboard fixes — is explicitly carried into E002's Scope. Strategy-level context is\n107\tcarried forward, not dropped: the renewal pressure on the VPAT appears in E002's\n108\tDescription and as a Health Warning on priority; missing strategy sections (teams,\n109\tdependencies, GWT ACs, NFRs) are recorded in Health Warnings with the inference\n110\tbasis for team assignments. No conditional branches are needed (no bounded-outcome\n111\tunknowns). Although the strategy lacks a Prerequisites & Process Gates section, HLR-3\n112\texplicitly requires the documentation deliverable and the docs-authoring epic is\n113\tpresent.\n114\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a467c07afac21b7f","agent_id":"a9c125d6ee58131ad","session_id":"85349235-cd13-47e8-af33-caa47bbf874d","uuid":"ba25bb3c-7aca-4604-a013-b3b3b78758aa","timestamp":"2026-10-26T22:20:08.955Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a83f89491520fdf8","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9017 decomposition"}
